  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meeting the objectives of the Syria Humanitarian Response Plan issued December 2020 that points to humanitarian needs amounting to 3.4 billion USD and succeeding response plans. Including  the objectives of the Syria Humanitarian Response Plan for 2022-23, which calls for 4.44 billion USD to reach 11.8 million people.</narrative>
  </description>
